  "description": "Featuring the patented DBS braking system the Mark Webb signature frame has been designed around Mark and his aggressive technical style of riding. He wanted a more traditional height frame but also wanted to keep his seat and top tube lower, we achieved this by lowering the BB height which also gave him more stability with a lower centre of gravity. Win win!\n\nA steeper head tube angle of 75.5º gave him that extra front end steepness which is critical with many front end tricks with modern technical riding.\n\nThe TWS frame is perfect for most terrains from the Park, Street and dirt.",
